nimate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I'm honest, the subject has been talked around in circles so much that I'm fairly sure it should be dropped.</div> </div> </div> </div> exactly one postafter me and Charlaquin <u>conclude the discussion <b>by agreeing</b></u>.<br /> <br /> I admit I wasn't expecting it. A 14 post discussion that ends with agreement, that never happens but it did. <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> Anyway. MachineIV, Filamena, what do you think of this - since this is what me and Charlaquin agreed on it would be interesting to hear what you think? It meets your 20% guideline.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>me</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heck, you could just move the Background section to the end of the document, entitle it &quot;Sample Character&quot;. Move the first part of The Escape (up to and including &quot;she decided that no one was going to save her&quot;) to be part of Sample Character. Then just tweak it so it's a bout a named Changeling. Would that work for you?</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" t